igam3-screen - manager of the 3.5" screen (Turing Smart Screen / TURZX, USB 1a86:5722) of the iGam3 M1

Components and licenses
-----------------------
- app/: turing-smart-screen-python 3.10.0, (c) Matthieu Houdebine and contributors, GPL-3.0-or-later
  https://github.com/mathoudebine/turing-smart-screen-python
  Modified: library/sensors/sensors_custom.py (data sources of the iGam3 theme), library/sensors/sensors_python.py
  (Intel integrated graphics), config.yaml; added library/sensors/sensors_intel_gpu.py and the theme res/themes/iGam3.
- tools/, the iGam3 theme and the installers (install.sh, setup-root.sh...): they use the library above, so they are
